Package: bshare
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Bryam Contreras <briamjoseelias@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/BryamContreras/BShare
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libstdc++6 (>= 13), libgcc-s1, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.56), libgbm1, libdrm2, network-manager, wpasupplicant, dnsmasq-base, polkitd | policykit-1
Description: Share files and screens over a local network
 BShare discovers nearby devices on the same LAN or Wi-Fi network and transfers
 files directly between them. It also supports local screen sharing.
 .
 NetworkManager, wpa_supplicant, dnsmasq and polkit are declared because BShare
 can create a temporary Wi-Fi hotspot when no local network is available.
